+    rename acceptance/{drafts/admin_lights_go_test.go.txt => go/admin_lights_test.go} (100%)
+
+\* before the one sanctioned spec edit below; the two Go files are
+byte-identical to their drafts — the regenerated manifest carries the SAME
+sha256 for `acceptance/go/admin_auth_test.go` (`6a48178…`) and
+`acceptance/go/admin_lights_test.go` (`1c7bd11…`) as the pre-activation
+manifest carried for the drafts. `acceptance/drafts/` is removed;
+`acceptance/README.md` now carries the frozen contract tables + per-assertion
+visual notes verbatim (packet rule 5), with its header prose rewritten from
+"inert drafts" to "activated" (the only non-verbatim part of that file).
+
+Holdout repo (`/Users/ascotti/Documents/git_repos/groveland-lights-holdout`):
+`drafts/admin_auth_holdout_go_test.go.txt → go/admin_auth_holdout_test.go`,
